# Notification badge

Use the [Ministry of Justice notification badge](https://design-patterns.service.justice.gov.uk/components/notification-badge/) for new or unread items that need attention. Associate it with the destination that opens those items. Do not use it for routine device totals or to label a sensor state.


## A count has a different job from a status

Follow the [message decision guide](status.html#choose-the-right-message) before adding a badge. This page owns attention-count geometry and count wording. A [tag](tag.html) names a state; a [notification banner](notification-banners.html) carries a message. Neither is a substitute for an unread count, and the count itself cannot communicate the severity of the underlying items.

